{#
Teraz — the product detail tabs.

theme-raed keeps the description inside the narrow info column, squeezed under the price and
the add-to-cart button, and clipped behind a "read more" link. On a fashion product the two
questions that actually decide the purchase — how does it fit, and can I send it back — have
nowhere to live at all.

So the description moves out here, full width, beside two merchant-written tabs. A tab is
rendered only when it has content, and the whole section disappears when none of them do, so
a merchant who fills nothing loses nothing.

Tabs are progressive: without JS every panel is visible and stacked, which is a readable page.
The script (js/partials/product-tabs.js) is what collapses them into tabs.
#}
{% set tz_desc = product.description|replace({"&nbsp;":"\n"})|trim %}
{% set tz_sizing = theme.settings.get('tz_tab_sizing') %}
{% set tz_shipping = theme.settings.get('tz_tab_shipping') %}

{% if tz_desc or tz_sizing or tz_shipping %}
    <section class="tz-tabs" data-tz-tabs>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="tz-tabs__bar" role="tablist">
                {% if tz_desc %}
                    <button type="button" class="tz-tabs__tab" role="tab" data-tz-tab="desc" aria-selected="true">{{ trans('pages.teraz.tab_description') }}</button>
                {% endif %}
                {% if tz_sizing %}
                    <button type="button" class="tz-tabs__tab" role="tab" data-tz-tab="sizing" aria-selected="false">{{ trans('pages.teraz.tab_sizing') }}</button>
                {% endif %}
                {% if tz_shipping %}
                    <button type="button" class="tz-tabs__tab" role="tab" data-tz-tab="shipping" aria-selected="false">{{ trans('pages.teraz.tab_shipping') }}</button>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            {% if tz_desc %}
                <div class="tz-tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" data-tz-panel="desc">
                    <article class="tz-prose">{{ tz_desc|raw }}</article>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if tz_sizing %}
                <div class="tz-tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" data-tz-panel="sizing">
                    <article class="tz-prose">{{ tz_sizing|raw }}</article>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if tz_shipping %}
                <div class="tz-tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" data-tz-panel="shipping">
                    <article class="tz-prose">{{ tz_shipping|raw }}</article>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </section>
{% endif %}
